e service. The property features 3 bathrooms, a large private terrace and a spacious multipurpose basement with excellent natural light.\n\nThe main living areas flow directly onto the terrace creating a seamless indoor and outdoor lifestyle. The generous basement offers flexible space for a home cinema, gym, office or games room. Large windows bring natural light into every level of the home.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to buy a golf front property in one of Cabopino&apos;s most ‌sought-after ‌locations. ‌This ‌apartment ‌is ‌ideal as ‌a permanent ‌residence, holiday home or investment ‌property ‌with ‌strong ‌appeal ‌for buyers looking for ‌luxury ‌living ‌on ‌the ‌Costa ‌del ‌Sol."},"features":{"es":["Primera línea de Golf","Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Puerto","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Colegios","Oeste","Excelente","Comunitaria","Cubierta","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Chimenea","Montaña","Golf","Panorámicas","Jardín","Terraza Cubierta","Ascensor","Armarios Empotrados","Terraza Privada","Gimnasio","Trastero","Sótano","Sin Amueblar","Cocina Comedor","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Más de uno","Comunitario","Golf","Lujo"],"en":["Frontline Golf","Close To Golf","Close To Port","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Schools","West","Excellent","Communal","Indoor","Air Conditioning","Central Heating","Fireplace","Mountain","Golf","Panoramic","Garden","Covered Terrace","Lift","Fitted Wardrobes","Private Terrace","Gym","Storage Room","Basement","Not Furnished","Kitchen-Lounge","Communal","Gated Complex","More Than One","Communal","Golf","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available"}